              "shortDescription": {
                "markdown": "CVE-2026-109924: undici vulnerable to Denial of Service via unbounded memory in the EventSource parser",
                "text": "CVE-2026-109924: undici vulnerable to Denial of Service via unbounded memory in the EventSource parser"
