              "shortDescription": {
                "markdown": "CVE-2026-104874: Multidict: Reference leak in CIMultiDict/MultiDict items-view union and subtraction",
                "text": "CVE-2026-104874: Multidict: Reference leak in CIMultiDict/MultiDict items-view union and subtraction"
