              "shortDescription": {
                "markdown": "CVE-2026-112400: Pillow: GIF seek keeps rejected size after DecompressionBombError, allowing DoS",
                "text": "CVE-2026-112400: Pillow: GIF seek keeps rejected size after DecompressionBombError, allowing DoS"
