              "shortDescription": {
                "markdown": "GHSA-78g4-xqwv-q3g8: Pillow: Bundled libopenjp2 2.5.4 in all wheels since 11.1.0 carries OSV-2025-219 heap-buffer-overflow write reachable from Image.open().load()",
                "text": "GHSA-78g4-xqwv-q3g8: Pillow: Bundled libopenjp2 2.5.4 in all wheels since 11.1.0 carries OSV-2025-219 heap-buffer-overflow write reachable from Image.open().load()"
